<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for getting in touch with us regarding the difficulties you encountered with our Q Streaming service, during your recent flight to {!Case.Arrival_Airport__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We know malfunctioning of our entertainment service can be very frustrating, so would like to apologise this important service wasn’t available on your flight. When this occurs our cabin crew will explore multiple avenues to restore the service, from rebooting the system to contacting engineering teams on the ground for advice, but there are times when no resolution can be implemented prior to landing.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If a Frequent Flyer:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of goodwill, I have credited {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of goodwill, I would like to arrange a credit of<span style="color: rgb(112, 110, 107); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> </span>{!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} Qantas Points to you. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Please advise us of your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email, so we can credit these points to your account. If you are not already a member, you can join free of charge via our website using the following <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/join-now.html/code/FAMILYFREE">link</a></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="2">Feedback from our customers is the best way for us to identify areas needing improvement or development, and I would like to assure you, your comments have been passed onto our engineering management for future consideration.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you again for contacting us and we look forward to welcoming you aboard again soon.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>